<title>JAPAN: Chuo Paperboard - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Chuo Paperboard - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.76		vs	   12.01</p>
<p> Operating	  690    million	  vs	  893    million</p>
<p> Current	    227    million	  vs	  401    million</p>
<p> Net	     loss 8.80		vs	prft 222 million</p>
